WEBVTT

00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:04.800
Reflexes before reasoning. A seed, building in the open.

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:11.050
Five rungs. Sense structurally first. Spend vision only where confused.

00:00:12.250 --> 00:00:17.950
Level zero reads the DOM. Level one checks the cache. Both free, both instant.

00:00:19.150 --> 00:00:23.800
Level two detects and reads: boxes, text, geometry first.

00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:30.875
Every action loops: observe, fuse, resolve, authorize, execute once, verify.

00:00:32.075 --> 00:00:37.475
Only confusion climbs higher: a crop, never the full frame, reaches the model.

00:00:38.675 --> 00:00:44.075
The full frame never reaches the model. Cost stays near zero by construction.

00:00:45.875 --> 00:00:50.675
Speed claims are hypotheses, not measurements. They must be benchmarked.

00:00:52.475 --> 00:00:59.275
Ten invariants: no blind retries, independent verification, humans confirm the dangerous.

00:01:00.475 --> 00:01:06.175
Seed status: real code, unproven loop.  Building in the open.

00:01:07.375 --> 00:01:12.050
Reflexes before reasoning.  Watch the seed.
